Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.90,0:01:39.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《鬼娃回魂2》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:55.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好 沙利文先生\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Mr. Sullivan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.23,0:03:56.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一会有个会要开\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a meeting in a few minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:03:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去和那些神经紧张的股东们会面\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with some very jittery stockholders, Mattson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你有好消息告诉我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you have good news for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:04.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 先生 我会的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. I do, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.16,0:04:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个小报头条都刊登了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every supermarket tabloid in the country
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于安迪·巴克利和他的杀手"好家伙"玩偶的故事\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is running headlines about Andy Barclay and his killer Good Guy doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:12.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈妈和警方怎么看待这事 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about his mother and the police that were on the case?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警方很聪明 他们否认这一切\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The police were smart. They denied everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这对我们没有什么坏处\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is fine because now they can't hurt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.38,0:04:16.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但安迪的妈妈却全然不同\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the mother's a different matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.54,0:04:18.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在法庭上支持了儿子的说法\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She backed up her boy's story in court,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:21.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以她现在在接受精神观察\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so now she's under psychiatric observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.09,0:04:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天 那孩子现在在哪 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus. Where's the boy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市中区儿童危机中心 受监护人照顾\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Midtown Children's Crisis Center. Foster custody is pending.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.85,0:04:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听了胃疼 马特森 这就是你说的好消息 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My stomach hurts, Mattson. Is this what you call good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:32.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 不 我正要说呢 先生\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes... No. I'm getting to that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.73,0:04:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们最大的问题在于那些谣言\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our biggest problem has been the rumors. A lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.69,0:04:36.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好 沙利文先生\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Mr. Sullivan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.56,0:04:39.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在开公司的玩笑\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of people are saying that some joker here at the company
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:42.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们还模仿玩偶的发声\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must have tampered with the doll's voice cassette, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.45,0:04:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"嗨 我叫恰吉 我是湖边的杀手"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Hi. I'm Chucky. I'm the Lakeshore Strangler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"现在我就要杀了你"有些就像\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"And now I'm gonna kill you." Something like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:52.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像这个样子\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:54.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 也有好消息 沙利文先生\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the good news, Mr. Sullivan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们找到了那个玩偶\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that now we've got the doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:04.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经从头到脚地重塑了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've rebuilt it from head to toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它已经大面积被烧毁了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of it was burned to a crisp,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:07.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过所有部件都检查过了 发声磁带 伺服系统\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but everything checks out, the voice cassettes, the servomechanisms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.97,0:05:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有发现任何问题\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've found absolutely nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一份质量认证报告\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a quality control report.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我敢说那些股东看了会很开心\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure it will make the stockholders very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:15.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要亲自看下那个玩偶\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to see the doll for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:16.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们 沙利文先生来了 准备好了吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, Mr. Sullivan's here. We ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍等一下 我们不太习惯人工操作\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, give us a minute. We're not used to making them manually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.51,0:05:51.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 出什么问题了 - 不知道 卡住了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's wrong? - I don't know. It's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:52.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:55.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会搞定的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll have this worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.99,0:06:08.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.59,0:06:24.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 你还在梦到恰吉吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, you still dreaming about Chucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:27.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时会\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.64,0:06:31.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 想谈谈它吗 - 不\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want to talk about it? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:34.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 安迪 还记得我和你说的吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Andy. Remember what I told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把问题说出来就可以\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talking helps make
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.64,0:06:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把梦魇赶走 - 把梦魇赶走\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- the nightmares go away. - The nightmares go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恰吉想控制我的灵魂\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Chucky was trying to take over my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:47.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:51.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个坏人 他进入了我的"好家伙"玩偶里\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was this bad man who got inside my Good Guy doll,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.12,0:06:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他才没有死去\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he wouldn't have to go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:55.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是后来他想进入我的体内\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then he wanted to get inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.25,0:06:57.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么 安迪 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为如果他呆在玩偶里的时间太长 他就出不来了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause if he stayed inside the doll too long, he'd be trapped in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他需要我是因为 我是第一个知道秘密的人\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needed me 'cause I was the first person he told his secret to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:09.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么秘密 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.43,0:07:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的真名叫查尔斯·李·雷\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That his real name was Charles Lee Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:17.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子 这只是个可怕的梦\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, that's a scary dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:20.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:24.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梦里的东西不会伤害你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dreams can't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为梦是假的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dreams aren't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.19,0:07:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对不对 - 对\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.53,0:07:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:36.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.12,0:07:42.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马森特 我不关心这些 不要把这事传开\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mattson, I don't care what it takes. Put a lid on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.88,0:07:44.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 先生 这没问题 我会保密的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. That's not a problem. I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:46.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.46,0:07:49.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要么摆平 要么24小时内自己走人 明白 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You smother this or you're out of here in 24 hours. You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.01,0:07:51.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.13,0:07:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 别打扰我了 我要去开会 必须走了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if you will excuse me, I've got a meeting I've got to get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.89,0:07:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要股东和我都可以赚到钱\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As far as the stockholders and I are concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:07:59.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事就算结了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this matter is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:01.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.89,0:08:03.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您想让我怎么处理这些玩偶 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want me to do with the doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:07.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塞你屁眼里吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stick it up your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:12.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 那几起谋杀事件让他精神受到严重创伤\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Naturally, he was badly traumatized by the murders,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.91,0:08:16.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好在他这个年龄很容易康复\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they bounce back pretty fast at that age.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.45,0:08:17.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怜的孩子\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.83,0:08:22.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪现在需要的是一个正常的家庭 一个新的开始\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What Andy needs now is a normal family environment, a fresh start
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:25.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和一个忘掉过去不愉快的机会\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a chance to forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:28.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们把很多孩子照顾得那么好\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since you two have done so well with so many kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:31.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他妈妈康复之前 希望他能得到你们的照顾\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we were hoping you might foster him until his mother recovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 正好我们可以多照顾一个 - 呃\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's always room for one more. - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那是什么意思 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.56,0:08:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 是这样的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.93,0:08:45.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他看起来很正常 这些是怎样影响了他 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seems normal enough, but how has all this affected him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.61,0:08:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了接受一些\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, in order to come to terms with
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:50.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令他难以理解的事情\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something he couldn't possibly understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.73,0:08:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把那些想象成了童话一般的故事\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he turned it all into a kind of fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:58.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他竟然坚持说是他的玩偶杀了人\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He insisted his doll was responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.78,0:09:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么玩偶被查尔斯·李·雷的灵魂控制了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said it was possessed by the soul of Charles Lee Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:04.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个湖边的杀人犯\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lakeshore Strangler.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:12.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他杀了很多人 以一种巫毒教的杀人仪式\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He murdered a dozen people in this series of ritual voodoo killings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:19.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们真有能力去照顾这样一个孩子吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we even qualified to take care of a boy like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:22.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白你的担虑 辛普森先生\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I understand your concern, Mr. Simpson,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.39,0:09:24.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我敢肯定 他只是在用一种孩子\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm sure you can see that this is just a child's way
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:28.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,处理问题的方式而已\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of coping with a difficult situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.81,0:09:30.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪现在已经没事了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy's fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.82,0:09:33.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只是想好好的生活\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just wants to get on with his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:43.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 你想吃什么 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Andy, what do you like to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:45.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都可以\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All kinds of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.42,0:09:49.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 你最喜欢吃什么呢 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what's your very favorite food in the whole wide world?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巧克力\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.21,0:09:53.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了巧克力呢\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:59.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈早餐经常给我准备鸡蛋 我喜欢鸡蛋\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm... My mom used to fix me eggs for breakfast. I like eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:02.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们就停到那家店旁边\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it. We should stop at the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:04.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 前面那家 - 没错 就那家有机食品店\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The one down here? - Yeah, the organic one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有口福了 安迪 乔安妮的厨艺超级棒\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in luck, Andy. Joanne's a terrific cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:12.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢吃寿司吗 你知道我说的是\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like sushi? You know what I mean by...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:13.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲尔 小心\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phil, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:14.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:40.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当心有车\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out for the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 等等我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 就当在自己家\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make yourself comfortable, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:56.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我下午得回办公室一趟\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I have to get back to the office this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.49,0:11:07.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你都处理好了呢\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought that you'd done everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:41.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah-ah-ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.45,0:11:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一条规定 不要动这些古董\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First rule. Don't touch the old stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.45,0:11:46.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 还好 没犯什么错\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's okay. No foul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 我们收集的这些\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just that we collect this junk,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:53.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古董都很容易碎\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a lot of it's kind of fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.67,0:11:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢它 - 恩啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You like it? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:57.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它在我家已经传了三代了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been in my family for three generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:12:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我外婆传给我母亲 母亲又传给了我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My grandmother gave it to my mother, and my mother gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.34,0:12:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你是要传给谁呢 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And who are you gonna give it to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.76,0:12:07.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先把行李提到楼上 顺便参观下\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you take this upstairs and explore?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一会就过去\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be up there in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:09.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.27,0:12:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么想的 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:23.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还要适应他一段时间\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get used to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天 你知道敲门不 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus. Did you ever hear of knocking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.05,0:12:47.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 你有没有找到\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, did you find...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.10,0:12:50.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 把它给我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, are you crazy? Give them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.35,0:12:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了 乔安妮\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Joanne.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果被菲尔看到 他会杀了你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phil will shoot you if he catches you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.64,0:12:56.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 这是凯尔 她也和我们住一块\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, this is Kyle. She's staying with us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.56,0:12:59.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸会\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:00.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔 这是什么 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.03,0:13:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都来三个星期了 行李怎么还没打开 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been here three weeks. Why haven't you unpacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.53,0:13:08.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开那干嘛 我就没在一个家里呆够过一月\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What for? I've never spent more than a month in any home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.49,0:13:11.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就冲这态度 我就知道原因了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With that attitude, I can see why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:12.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 把这些收走\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Put these things away,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后 过来帮我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then would you do me a favor
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.62,0:13:14.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备晚餐 好吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and help me get dinner started?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.00,0:13:17.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 今晚要去打工\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't. Got to work tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔 已经连续三晚了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle, that's the third night in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真心希望你能花点时间陪陪家里的人\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd really like it if you'd spend a little time with the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要钱 明年我就靠自己了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need the money. I'm gonna be on my own next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:30.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 但在那之前 你还有我们 不是吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, well, until then, you're with us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:34.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们走 安迪 - 拜拜\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come along, Andy. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.98,0:13:37.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这我想你会开心的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you'll be very happy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.40,0:13:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你的房间\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your room, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.79,0:13:55.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我专门给你做了这窗帘\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made those curtains just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:57.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜你喜欢蓝色\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet blue is your favorite color.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:14:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便看看吧 我去把行李收好\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look around. I'll start to unpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:05.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.93,0:14:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜你喜欢的 嗯 柜子里还有呢\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you might like those. Um... There's more in the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.81,0:14:15.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚饭前 我们先参观下后院\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before dinner, we'll go explore the backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.14,0:14:18.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚点 我再讲故事给你听\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, later, I'll read you some stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.77,0:14:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.61,0:14:22.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邻居有很多像你这么大的小朋友\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are lots of kids your age in the neighborhood, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信你会认识很多新朋友的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you're going to make all sorts of new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.49,0:14:31.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿嘿\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 第二条规定 不许在房间里奔跑\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, rule number two, no running in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:38.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是个玩偶 你在听我说吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only a doll. Andy, are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 对不起 安迪 我没看到它在那\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Andy, I'm so sorry. I didn't realize that was in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.59,0:14:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这有很多孩子 很难搞清所有东西在哪\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've had so many kids here, it's hard to keep track of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去把它丢掉\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:48.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 我叫汤米 我会是你永远的朋友\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, I'm Tommy. And I'm your friend till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:52.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先住进来 然后去吃晚饭 好吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we get settled in, and then we'll have some dinner, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.48,0:15:06.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.57,0:15:56.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 加布里埃拉 猜猜我谁\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Gabriella. Guess who?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:15:59.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错是我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:03.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伏特加 我当然记得伏特加了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vodka? The vodka. Of course I remembered the vodka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.38,0:16:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长达两周的周年庆 我怎么会把它忘了呢\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two-week anniversary. You think I'd forget the vodka?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道它对你来说很重要\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what that does to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题 等我吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, well, wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:13.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在路上\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my way. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:16.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.17,0:16:54.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想玩"红灯"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to play Red Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.59,0:16:56.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 萨米 我现在不想玩什么"红灯"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Sammy, I don't want to play Red Light now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:16:58.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该马上回去睡觉\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to go back to bed right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.47,0:17:00.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我害怕\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.47,0:17:03.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么可怕的 只是暴风雨而已\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing to be scared of. It's just a storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.94,0:17:08.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克雷斯·普尔\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grace Poole.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.82,0:17:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想找安迪·巴克利\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I'm trying to reach Andy Barclay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:14.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪已经不住这了 你是谁 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy no longer lives here. Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:17.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是他的叔叔 查尔斯\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is his Uncle Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:21.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 只收现金\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, cash only.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:25.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可这是金卡啊 和现金一样用\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's a gold card. That's just as good as cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:28.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿不行 我们不刷信用卡\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not here, it ain't. We don't accept credit cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:31.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我没带现金啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't carry cash, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.30,0:18:19.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.97,0:18:23.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 你想要什么 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God. Okay. Okay, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.68,0:18:26.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别多问 开你的车 - 好 好\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No questions. Just drive. - Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.03,0:18:35.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续往前\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这 停车\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, park this piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手背在座子后面\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your arms behind the seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.01,0:19:07.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想做什么 - 照做\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.14,0:19:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 好 冷静 冷静 别开枪\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Take it easy. Take it easy. Please, don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.40,0:19:16.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没带现金 我只有张金卡\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't carry cash. I got a gold card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.32,0:19:18.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要什么我都给你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give you anything you want. Tell me what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.57,0:19:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的 别乱动\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:24.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车 车归你了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take my... Take the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.45,0:19:27.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我扔下车就行 求你放过我吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you can drop me off, but just, please, leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.62,0:19:29.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:30.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bang. You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.77,0:20:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别 别\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!No!No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.58,0:20:56.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"伐木工跟他妻子争吵了很久"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The woodcutter argued for a long time with his wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.29,0:20:59.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"但她生起气来会变得很可怕"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"but she was such a horrid, frightening woman when she was angry,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.17,0:21:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"最后 他只好同意了她的计划"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"that in the end he agreed to her plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:05.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"早上 继母过来叫他们"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"In the morning, their stepmother called them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.55,0:21:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说"我们一起去森林吧"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I think it would be nice if we all went into the forest today," she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.43,0:21:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"韩赛尔与格蕾特并没有答复"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Hansel and Gretel did not reply,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:13.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"只是跟着父母进入了丛林深处"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"but followed their parents into the dark forest."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:16.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从此 他们过着快乐的生活\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where they all lived happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.19,0:21:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 他们没有 - 现在 他们有\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, they don't. - Well, they do for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.19,0:21:20.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明晚 我们再继续讲\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll finish it tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.65,0:21:23.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别走\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.07,0:21:25.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么事儿 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.91,0:21:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想妈妈了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:29.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 我知道你想\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, honey, I know you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:32.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还能见到妈妈吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will I ever see her again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.25,0:21:33.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然能 我保证\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you will. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.67,0:21:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 我会陪着你的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. I'll stay with you as long as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:45.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈经常唱歌给我听 你能唱给我听吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother used to sing to me. Will you sing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.17,0:22:20.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.42,0:22:21.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 我是汤米\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. I'm Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴 白痴\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.71,0:22:29.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢被拥抱 我喜欢被拥抱\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like to be hugged. I like to be hugged. I like to be hugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.26,0:22:30.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢被拥抱\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like to be hugged...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.47,0:22:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱你个头\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hug this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.80,0:22:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢被拥抱 我喜欢被拥抱\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like to be hugged. I like to be hugged. I like...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.43,0:22:39.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么声音 - 没什么 乖乖睡吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was that? - Nothing. Now, go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:42.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人会伤害你的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's going to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.23,0:23:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米 吃屎去吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat dirt, Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.03,0:23:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们谁想说说这事 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do either of you have anything to say about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.03,0:23:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得应该先找律师谈谈\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should talk to a lawyer first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.03,0:23:36.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔 别开玩笑了 那雕像对我很重要\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle, that's not funny. That statue was very important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.08,0:23:41.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们中有一个该向乔安妮道歉\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think one of you owes Joanne an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.79,0:23:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不关我的事\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.46,0:23:45.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.92,0:23:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我做的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.09,0:23:52.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我没得选择了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. You leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.89,0:23:55.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在有人坦白前 谁都别离开这\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until somebody fesses up, you're both grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.35,0:23:58.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今晚有约\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I have a date tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:23:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那对不起了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.85,0:24:05.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真该感谢你给了我一个放假的机会\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is exactly how I wanted to spend my day off. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.02,0:24:08.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我真的没有打碎那个雕像\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I didn't break the statue. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.40,0:24:11.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 也许它是自己掉下去的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Maybe it just fell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.86,0:24:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 你想让我背对着你说话吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. You want to hear me say your name backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.45,0:24:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.04,0:24:21.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.71,0:24:31.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 把它给我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus. Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.05,0:24:33.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你他妈到底想干什么 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.72,0:24:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是想尝尝什么味儿\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to taste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.47,0:24:37.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话 就是狗屎味\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get real. It tastes like shit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.39,0:24:39.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些东西对你没好处\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These things are very bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.39,0:24:40.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你为什么还吸呢 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.06,0:24:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为只有大人才可以做那些对他们有害的事\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because grown-ups are allowed to do things that are bad for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.40,0:24:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可你也不是大人\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not a grown-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.65,0:24:50.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 你让我感到头疼了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're beginning to get on my nerves, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.94,0:24:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你过来帮我吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, why don't you give me a hand over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.91,0:25:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛普森先生脾气不太好啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Simpson is kind of grouchy, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.62,0:25:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还不算糟\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.29,0:25:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要换做我以前待过的那家 你要是斜着眼看他们\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had fosters that would shoot you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.46,0:25:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非杀了你不可\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for staring at them cross-eyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.25,0:25:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.42,0:25:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是真的了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.50,0:25:10.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟又不是他们亲生的 不过是领养的而已\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They figure you're not theirs. You're just passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.01,0:25:12.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你一犯错\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The minute you screw up...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.97,0:25:14.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会严厉地惩罚你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Argh! They let you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.27,0:25:25.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事让我很不高兴\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to tell you, I'm not happy with this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.31,0:25:27.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再考虑考虑吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having second thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.69,0:25:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得承认 他是个麻烦的孩子吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you have to admit, he's a very troubled little boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.94,0:25:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 他明显还没有忘记那个玩偶事件\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he obviously has not come to terms with this whole doll thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.66,0:25:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可能需要多一点照顾\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, all I'm saying is that he may need
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.95,0:25:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我们给不了他\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}more attention than we can give him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.37,0:25:47.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲尔 安迪有过可怕的经历\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phil, Andy's been through hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.33,0:25:51.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得多给他些时间 他会好起来的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to give him some time. He'll settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.80,0:25:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 我挺喜好他\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.36,0:26:13.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讨厌你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.44,0:26:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 我是 汤米 我是你永远的朋友\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. I'm...Tommy, and I'm your friend to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.49,0:26:20.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 哦\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi-de-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.15,0:26:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.23,0:26:54.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.29,0:27:11.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔 你想你的爸爸妈妈吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle, do you miss your mom and dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.34,0:27:15.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会去想从来不认识的人的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't miss someone you never knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.92,0:27:17.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在哪 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.63,0:27:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.59,0:27:22.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没出生 我爸爸就死了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad left before I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.76,0:27:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我三岁的时候 我妈把我送给别人抚养\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mom put me up for adoption when I was three.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.89,0:27:28.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得她吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.27,0:27:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我试着去忘了她\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made it a point to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.56,0:27:35.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样会好受点\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's easier that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.73,0:27:39.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 休息时间到了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Break time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.86,0:27:41.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下来吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.24,0:27:43.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我推吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want a push?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.45,0:27:44.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.12,0:27:46.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 很好玩的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. It's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.58,0:27:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 我就是想坐下来休息会\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Andy, please, I just want to sit here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.37,0:27:51.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说晚了 起来了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too late. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.42,0:27:54.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 让我休息会 停\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, come on. Give me a break. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.63,0:27:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.09,0:27:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 我要杀了你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.26,0:28:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我下去\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.93,0:28:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.56,0:28:08.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会抓住你的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.68,0:28:11.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 安迪 放开 - 吃晚饭了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Andy, cut it out. - Dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.85,0:28:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.69,0:28:14.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.86,0:28:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 我们比赛跑步\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayhem. Come on. I'll race you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.28,0:28:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不公平 你抢跑了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not fair. You got a head start.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.24,0:28:23.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了你的玩偶\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuses,excuses. Don't forget your doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.68,0:29:35.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔呢 她会喜好吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Kyle. Think she'll like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.02,0:29:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道女孩子喜欢什么 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I know about teenage girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.86,0:29:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定比三周前更了解了吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More than you did three weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.23,0:29:40.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不敢肯定\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.57,0:29:42.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想要给安迪什么呢\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was thinking we should get something for Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.32,0:29:43.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他觉得已经安定下来了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make him feel more settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.69,0:29:44.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么想法吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.82,0:29:46.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安定剂怎么样 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. How about a Valium?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.87,0:29:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃惊吗\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.71,0:30:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想我了吗 安迪 我可是很想你啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you miss me, Andy? I sure missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.96,0:30:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉过你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.67,0:30:06.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会是永远的朋友\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were going to be friends to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.59,0:30:09.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在又到玩的时间了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now it's time to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.72,0:30:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想到一个新游戏 老朋友\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a new game, sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.85,0:30:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它叫做"灵魂隐匿"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called Hide the Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.27,0:30:20.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你猜怎么玩 你是主角\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And guess what? You're it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.28,0:30:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.24,0:30:29.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我祈求你 赐予我力量吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the power, I beg...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.91,0:30:33.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事还没完 小鬼\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't over, you little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.37,0:30:36.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不想在这该死的橡胶玩具里度过余生\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna spend the rest of my life as a plastic freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.29,0:30:39.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次你一个人的时候 你就是我的了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time you're alone, you're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.25,0:30:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.38,0:30:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是恰吉 看啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Chucky. Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.88,0:30:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴吧 你会把菲尔和乔安妮吵醒的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up. You'll wake Phil and Joanne.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.18,0:30:51.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了他 杀了他\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him! Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.30,0:30:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 够了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, stop it, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.76,0:30:55.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.35,0:30:59.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是恰吉 他找到我了 他想要控制我的灵魂\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Chucky. I told you he'd find me. He tried to take over my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.44,0:31:01.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 冷静下来\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.73,0:31:03.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用起来的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't have to wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.36,0:31:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 凯尔 我可不相信你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? You know, Kyle, I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.28,0:31:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把安迪绑起来 让他不能说你坏话\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You actually tied this child up, so he wouldn't tell on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.28,0:31:11.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对不对 - 别说了 菲尔\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that it? - Come on, Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.16,0:31:12.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是恰吉干的 - 可以了啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Chucky did it. - That's enough now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.95,0:31:14.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恰吉 我知道了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chucky? I've had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.54,0:31:18.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得把他杀了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you've got to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.25,0:31:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.29,0:31:23.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请听我说 我没有骗你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, listen to me. I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:25.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不杀他 他还会来找我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't kill him, he'll come get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.80,0:31:28.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 冷静一下\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.38,0:31:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去把他丢掉\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.89,0:31:38.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到没 丢掉了 他再也不会伤害到你了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, see? He's gone. He can't bother you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.15,0:31:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.57,0:31:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还能变回人类吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm turning human again?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.33,0:31:57.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果还不赶快离开这个身体 就坏事了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't get out of this body soon, I'm screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.79,0:32:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 安迪 我们要迟到了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Andy. We're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.58,0:32:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 你的午餐\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy. Don't forget your lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.67,0:32:08.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸡蛋沙拉\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Egg salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.69,0:32:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你做什么 别那么紧张 好吗\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, whatever you do, don't act nervous, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.40,0:32:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然没人和你玩 要表现得像他们亲生的一样\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll smell a new kid a mile off. Just act like you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.57,0:32:29.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找什么呢 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.78,0:32:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 没什么\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.40,0:32:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是恰吉来找你了 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it Chucky coming to get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.33,0:32:39.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 你昨晚把自己绑起来 是怎么做到的 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, how did you manage to tie yourself up like that last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.20,0:32:40.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就告诉过你了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.66,0:32:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get real.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.96,0:32:46.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和他们一样 都不相信我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just like everybody else. You don't believe me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.63,0:32:50.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 凯尔 - 嗨 亚当\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kyle? - Hey, Adam. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.38,0:32:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚怎么走那么早 你错过了很多有趣的事\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you have to leave so early last night? You missed all the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.26,0:32:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 我真悲剧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Story of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.15,0:33:56.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点来吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.45,0:33:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪呢 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.78,0:34:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪呢 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.29,0:34:04.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.46,0:34:10.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"皮诺曹高兴地跳起来 大喊 我活了 我活了"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Pinocchio jumped for joy, shouting, I'm alive! I'm alive!"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.63,0:34:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"那只会说话的蟋蟀说"他会说什么呢 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Then the talking cricket said..." What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.17,0:34:17.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"如果你表现得足够好 并且保证不说谎话"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"If you're very, very good, and promise to tell no lies,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.59,0:34:20.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"你就会变成一个真正的有生命的小孩"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"then you will become a real, live boy."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.43,0:34:23.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"而那些反复无常的孩子"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Boys who are bent on following their caprices
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.22,0:34:27.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"会得到应有的报应 迟早会后悔的"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"and will have their own way, sooner or later repent."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.64,0:34:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别碰我"小薯片"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get lost, microchip.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.77,0:34:31.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 我惹你烦了吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I boring you, Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.27,0:34:33.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 凯特\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Miss...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.32,0:34:34.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯特韦尔\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kettlewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.99,0:34:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯特韦尔小姐\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kettlewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.70,0:34:39.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对捣乱的学生没多少耐心\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have precious little patience for disruptive students.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.62,0:34:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他刚才敲我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he just whacked...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.16,0:34:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是新生 更应该\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially new students, whose utmost concern
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.58,0:34:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表现好一点\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}should be getting on my good side.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.54,0:34:51.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走之前把课桌摆放整齐 清理干净\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want those desks spick and span before anyone leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.31,0:35:13.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 你觉得这很好玩吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy! You think this is funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.02,0:35:15.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我干的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.94,0:35:19.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下课了 别忘了明天的拼写测验\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, kids. Don't forget the spelling test tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.82,0:35:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你是谁 过来 在这坐着\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you. Come over here. Sit down and get comfy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.24,0:35:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这呆着\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to be here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.99,0:35:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发誓 不是我干的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I didn't do it, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.79,0:35:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你 那是谁啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No? Then who did?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.79,0:35:32.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再说是玩具做的了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.96,0:35:37.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有玩具 头趴下\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No toys. Head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.85,0:35:52.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.52,0:36:37.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来玩捉迷藏\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peekaboo!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.61,0:36:41.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 放我出去\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, let me out of here, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.45,0:36:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里很黑\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dark in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.11,0:36:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证 我不再杀人了 好吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise I won't kill anyone else. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.12,0:36:50.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开这该死的门\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, open the goddamn door.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.75,0:36:54.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我出去 你这小混蛋\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me out, you little dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.50,0:36:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你他妈放我出去\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me the fuck out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.27,0:37:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 我说过呆在你座位上 离开那\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, I told you to stay in your seat. Come out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.86,0:37:23.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把门打开\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open this door right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.08,0:37:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 快点出来\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, come out this very second.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.99,0:37:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 安迪\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy! Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.21,0:37:37.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.39,0:37:54.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.19,0:38:06.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 这不好玩\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, this isn't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.56,0:38:41.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好淘气啊 凯特韦尔小姐\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been very naughty, Miss Kettlewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.43,0:39:10.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 整件事是怎么样的 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, what's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.26,0:39:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恰吉跟踪我到学校 他还想再抓我 我就回家了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chucky followed me to school. He tried to get me again, so I ran home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.93,0:39:17.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他在说什么吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.77,0:39:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的老师打电话过来\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His teacher called,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.98,0:39:21.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他放学后留堂\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}said she was keeping him after school for detention,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.94,0:39:24.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说他在纸上写些污言秽语\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}said he wrote an obscenity on his paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.78,0:39:27.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是恰吉写的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chucky did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.11,0:39:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 安迪 过来\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Andy. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.20,0:39:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事就这样结束了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is going to stop,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.70,0:39:34.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不允许在我家里发生这种事\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause I will not allow this foolishness in my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.79,0:39:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你明白吗 开门 - 菲尔\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you understand? Open the door. - Oh, Phil...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.79,0:39:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔安妮 别说了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joanne, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.54,0:39:44.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.59,0:39:48.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.64,0:39:52.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.52,0:40:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你看着那 告诉我看到了什么\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I want you to look down there and tell me what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.98,0:40:06.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了恰吉 但\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Chucky, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.07,0:40:10.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫汤米\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Tommy,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.03,0:40:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他从昨晚就在那了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he's been there since last night, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.24,0:40:16.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.92,0:40:25.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别伤心了 乔安妮 这孩子需要专业的帮助\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For crying out loud, Joanne, the child needs professional help.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.96,0:40:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就别假装在关心他了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop pretending you're worried about Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.67,0:40:29.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从一开始就不想他住在这\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never wanted him here in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.34,0:40:30.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这样的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.05,0:40:33.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你想让我怎么做 把他送回去\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what are you suggesting we do? Send him back?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.47,0:40:35.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用这么大吼大叫\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to make it sound so horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.51,0:40:37.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道这种创伤会带来什么吗\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea how traumatic that would be?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.97,0:40:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创伤 谁 你还是他 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traum... For whom, Joanne, for him or for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.77,0:40:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他还住在这里 早晚会把整个家庭拆散\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if that kid stays here, he's gonna tear this family apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.44,0:40:48.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家庭 这就是你所谓的家庭 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Family? Is this what you call a family?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.07,0:40:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家庭是不会放弃他们孩子的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Families don't just give up on their children.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.28,0:40:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔安妮 他又不是我们的孩子\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joanne, he's not our child.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.08,0:41:05.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是世界末日\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.38,0:41:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可他们要把我送走\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they're going to send me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.01,0:41:17.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.31,0:41:20.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能去哪 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where will I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.52,0:41:22.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.85,0:41:26.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在很多不同的家庭待过\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've lived with dozens of different families,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.02,0:41:29.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我开始习惯下来时\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they always seem to send me away
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.07,0:41:31.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就想着把我送走\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just when I'm getting comfortable,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.03,0:41:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道这对我有什么影响吗 - 什么 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- but you know what? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.36,0:41:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次都会让我变得更加坚强\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time it happens, it just makes me stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.37,0:41:42.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这提醒着我 唯一能依靠的就是自己\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because it reminds me that the only one I can count on is myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.33,0:41:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 你从现在开始就要学习变得坚强\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? And you have to learn that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.13,0:41:49.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这话听着不舒服\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it sounds tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.63,0:41:51.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你要去面对\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you'll deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.30,0:41:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.76,0:41:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管我去哪 恰吉都会找到我的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wherever I go, Chucky will find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.59,0:46:07.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以7比6的微弱优势\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...advances over the declines by a seven to six margin...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.43,0:46:11.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.18,0:46:14.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像听到楼下有什么动静\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I heard something downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.73,0:46:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是某个孩子吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's one of the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.31,0:46:18.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这正是我担心的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'm afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.19,0:46:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要反抗 我们马上就会更加亲密了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why fight it, Andy? We're going to be very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.15,0:46:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很快就分不开了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, we're going to be fucking inseparable.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.25,0:46:42.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on down...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.96,0:46:46.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.72,0:46:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把刀子放下\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put down the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.89,0:46:50.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要用它来\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I need it for...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.60,0:46:55.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先把刀子放下 我们来谈谈\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just put the knife down, and we'll talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.15,0:47:07.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都会好起来的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything is going to be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.96,0:47:27.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒吊起来的滋味怎么样 菲尔 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's it hanging, Phil?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.10,0:47:40.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 天啊 菲尔\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Oh, God, Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.11,0:47:43.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去叫救护车\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.15,0:47:45.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲尔 菲尔\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phil. Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.90,0:47:49.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 天啊 不\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.07,0:47:51.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.74,0:47:54.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从我眼前消失\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.45,0:47:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.13,0:48:10.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我们什么也没听到\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we didn't hear anything. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.83,0:48:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该听他的话的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have listened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.50,0:48:43.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我当初听他的 他就不会死了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd be here now if only I'd listened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.00,0:48:50.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是你的错\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.76,0:48:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来拿吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.73,0:49:12.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 你会没事的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, you'll be fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.70,0:49:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我们在这呆几天吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come stay at the center with us for a few days
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.37,0:49:17.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们再给你找个新的家庭\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until we can find you a new family.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.70,0:49:21.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也给凯尔找过很多个家庭了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've placed Kyle with a number of families.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.04,0:49:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都会好起来的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things always seem to work out okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.75,0:49:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不啊 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.54,0:49:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.51,0:49:33.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的东西\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.14,0:49:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 安迪 我们走\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Andy. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.18,0:49:43.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还在地下室 不要被他缠上\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still in the cellar, Kyle. Don't let him get you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.81,0:49:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.37,0:50:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很快就完事\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be out of your way in just a minute here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.74,0:50:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了这个男孩 还有谁看到了事故的经过 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did anyone, besides the boy, witness the accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.21,0:50:07.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没 - 好的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.00,0:50:09.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.97,0:52:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔安妮\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joanne!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.01,0:52:26.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔安妮\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joanne!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.21,0:54:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔安妮 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joanne?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.52,0:54:37.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔安妮\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joanne!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.42,0:55:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贱货 你弄伤我了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitch. You hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.80,0:55:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还要多久才到 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much further till we get to the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.93,0:55:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要一段路程\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.27,0:55:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开快点\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.77,0:56:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛这么急啊 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.19,0:56:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我不能尽快离开这身体 就再也出不去了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't get out of this body soon, I'll be trapped in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.44,0:56:07.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看什么看 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.50,0:56:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Floor it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.75,0:56:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说 这车只能开这么快了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get real. This is a station wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.46,0:56:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.83,0:56:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠边停车\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull over.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.60,0:56:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我注意点\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behave yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.68,0:56:42.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我随时可以杀了你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you if lhave to.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.31,0:56:46.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看一下你驾照\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, honey, let's see your license.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.28,0:56:54.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里限速45 你开到了60 什么事这么着急 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were clocking 60 in a 45. What's your hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.12,0:56:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个约会\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.08,0:57:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好换个理由\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to have to do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.83,0:57:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个"好家伙"玩偶吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's one of those Good Guys, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.83,0:57:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.34,0:57:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜好这东西 你叫什么名字 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love these things. What's your name, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.84,0:57:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恰吉\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.80,0:57:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太不可思议了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.43,0:57:16.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想说\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.76,0:57:19.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.48,0:57:27.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你见过会撒尿的玩偶吗 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've seen dolls that pee?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.94,0:57:29.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个会流血\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one bleeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.41,0:57:35.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.45,0:57:38.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢一点开\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just slow it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.58,0:57:41.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系上安全带\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And buckle up for safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.33,0:57:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.80,0:58:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧 宝贝 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.60,0:58:01.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.06,0:58:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别被虫子咬了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let the bedbugs bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.75,0:58:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 再快点\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Step on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.04,0:58:29.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们刚才又超速了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. We'll just get pulled over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.38,0:58:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴 开你的车 不然我打碎你的牙\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just shut up and drive before I kick your fucking teeth in.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.98,0:58:49.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你个该死的女司机\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You goddamn women drivers!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.28,0:59:01.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.45,0:59:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你妈的 混蛋\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.26,0:59:23.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit. Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.29,0:59:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娱乐时间结束了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Playtime's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.05,1:00:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 你在干什么 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.88,1:00:40.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 我们要离开这里\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We've got to get out of the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.72,1:00:44.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔 你在这干什么\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.39,1:00:48.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你做的 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did this, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.89,1:00:52.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他做的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.23,1:00:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来我办公室\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get into my office.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.20,1:01:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是这样开玩笑的 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this your idea of a joke?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.41,1:01:08.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那个给我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.24,1:01:10.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃惊了 是吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.80,1:01:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.22,1:01:30.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来玩一个叫"恰吉说"的游戏\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, sport, we're going to have a little game of Chucky Says.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.06,1:01:33.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恰吉说"别磨蹭"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chucky says, "Move your ass."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.65,1:01:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作起来\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.23,1:01:40.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就当这里没那个死人\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You act like you've never seen a dead body before.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.99,1:01:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 开门\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, come on! Open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.37,1:01:53.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 快开门\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy! Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.29,1:01:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人出去\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Everybody out!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.44,1:02:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去 快\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.42,1:02:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.05,1:02:52.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.89,1:02:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.06,1:02:56.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.49,1:03:10.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐 开慢一点\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, lady, slow down, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.79,1:03:20.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经过\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* Passin' by *
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.74,1:03:54.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说出你的祈祷 安迪\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say your prayers, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.91,1:04:00.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.60,1:04:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠边\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull over!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.44,1:04:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.77,1:04:23.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠边\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull over!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.69,1:04:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠边\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull over!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.16,1:04:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当你在做什么啊 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just what in the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.21,1:04:43.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我走 放我走\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go. Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.04,1:04:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你他妈有病是吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.51,1:04:50.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我走\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.67,1:04:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死疯子\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crazy bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.11,1:05:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到家了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're home.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.07,1:05:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛 数到七\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close your eyes and count to seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.33,1:06:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你醒来 就在天堂了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you wake, you'll be in heaven.
