Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.35,1:06:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我祈求你 赐予我力量吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the power, I beg of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.30,1:07:36.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.56,1:07:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你个小杂种\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You little shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.56,1:07:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你刚才做了什么吗\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.56,1:07:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太迟了 我在身体里耽搁太久了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late. I've spent too much time in this body.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.36,1:07:54.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我他妈要被困在里面了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fucking trapped in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.28,1:07:57.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.40,1:08:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 快跑\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, run.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.96,1:08:13.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 安迪 - 凯尔\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Andy. - Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.96,1:08:16.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧 来\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.57,1:08:39.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.24,1:08:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 快点\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.89,1:09:13.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走 我在前面 跟紧我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. I'll go first. Stay right behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.45,1:09:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.17,1:09:39.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 快一点\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, step on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.13,1:09:42.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加把劲 把手给我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reach! Give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.26,1:09:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 停下来 抓住边上\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy! Stop yourself. Grab the side.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.35,1:09:53.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 快 他就在你后面\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy! Hurry up! He's right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.02,1:09:55.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你个混蛋\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.36,1:10:07.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要往后看 往前爬 快点\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look back. Come on. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.49,1:10:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你逃不出我的手心\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.62,1:10:13.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手伸过来\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand!
