Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.64,1:10:37.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会抓到你的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to get you fuckers.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.82,1:10:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.83,1:10:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.45,1:11:37.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来 你能行\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.38,1:11:47.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来 把手伸过来\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.05,1:11:49.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要害怕 加油\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be afraid. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.10,1:11:54.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再近一点 就能抓到我的手了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Closer. Closer so you can grab my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.56,1:11:57.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 就现在\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.78,1:12:10.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打不开\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't open it.
