Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.24,1:12:14.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们找另一条路 把手给我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have to find another way. Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.24,1:12:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讨厌小孩\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.97,1:12:34.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有异常\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terrific.
