Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.11,1:15:35.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪 求你了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.78,1:15:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是跟你玩玩\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was only playing.
