Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.04,1:16:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.91,1:16:31.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们做到了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it.
