Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.61,1:17:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让我看看 你没事吧 - 没事\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's see. Are you okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.49,1:17:01.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.86,1:17:03.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你来找我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for coming after me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.20,1:17:05.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你欠我一次啊 小鬼\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, you owe me one, squirt.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.95,1:17:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle!
