Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.79,1:17:53.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.73,1:18:14.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔 凯尔\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle! Kyle!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.90,1:18:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔 凯尔 醒一醒\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle! Kyle! Kyle, wake up!
