Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.82,1:18:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走 走\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.47,1:18:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 你对他做了什么 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugh! God. What did you do to him?
