Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.65,1:19:06.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯尔 凯尔\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kyle! Kyle!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.49,1:19:16.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃屎去吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat this, you son of a bitch.
