Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.72,1:20:15.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.68,1:20:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家在哪 \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's home?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.48,1:20:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy, I have no idea.
